<header class="rm-head"><h1>Support desk</h1><p>Chat directly with customers. Your replies are written by you; no AI replies are generated.</p></header>
<section class="card card-body" data-support-desk data-staff-account="<%= account.id %>" data-after="<%= after||'' %>" data-time-zone="<%= account.timeZone||'UTC' %>"><p role="status" data-support-live-status>You are offline. Choose Go online when you are available.</p><button class="btn btn--primary" type="button" data-support-presence aria-pressed="false">Go online for live chat</button><p>Keep this desk or a support conversation open while accepting live chats. Customers can leave a message for email follow-up when you are offline.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Conversation</th><th>Channel</th><th>Priority</th><th>Received</th><th>First response target</th><th>Assigned</th></tr></thead><tbody data-support-queue><% for(const r of tickets){ %><tr><td><a href="/commercial-admin/support/<%= r.id %>"><%= r.subject %></a></td><td><%= r.channel %></td><td><%= r.priority===2?'Priority chat':r.priority===1?'Priority email':'Standard' %></td><td><%= helpers.dateTime(r.created_at) %></td><td><%= r.first_response_at?'Responded':r.first_response_due_at?helpers.dateTime(r.first_response_due_at):'No agreed deadline' %></td><td><%= r.assigned_name||'Unassigned' %></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div><nav aria-label="Support queue pages"><a href="/commercial-admin/support">First page</a><a data-support-next href="<%= nextCursor?'/commercial-admin/support?after='+encodeURIComponent(nextCursor):'/commercial-admin/support' %>" <%= nextCursor?'':'hidden' %>>Next conversations</a></nav></section>
<% const me=staffProfiles.find(p=>p.account_id===account.id); %><section class="card card-body"><h2>Your support contact profile</h2><p>Save your public name and support email before going online. Only existing support administrators can manage this desk.</p><form method="post" action="/commercial-admin/support/profile"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label class="field">Public support name<input class="input" name="displayName" maxlength="120" value="<%= me?.display_name||account.name %>" required></label><label class="field">Public support contact email<input class="input" type="email" name="contactEmail" maxlength="254" value="<%= me?.contact_email||'support@stockchiefhq.com' %>" required></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="active" value="1" checked> Available for assignment</label><button class="btn" type="submit">Save support profile</button></form></section><script src="/support-chat.js?v=<%= assetVersion %>" defer></script>
